  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとと　くらすようになった\nさいしょの　ポケモンと　いわれる。\nおだやかな　せいかくの　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람과 살기 시작한\n최초의 포켓몬이라고 한다.\n온화한 성격의 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon paisible serait le premier à avoir jamais\ncohabité avec les humains.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Man sagt, es sei eines der ersten Pokémon,\ndie mit Menschen zusammengelebt haben.\nEs ist sehr ruhig und friedfertig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que fue la primera especie de Pokémon que se\nacostumbró a vivir con los seres humanos. Tiene una\nnaturaleza muy afable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un carattere pacifico ed è considerato il primo\nPokémon ad avere stretto amicizia con l’uomo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Thought to be one of the first Pokémon to live in\nharmony with humans, it has a placid disposition.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人と　暮らすようになった\n最初の　ポケモンと　言われる。\n穏やかな　性格の　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que fue la primera especie de Pokémon que se\nacostumbró a vivir con los seres humanos. Tiene una\nnaturaleza muy afable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みずと　たいようが　あれば　せなかの\nはっぱで　エネルギーが　つくれるので\nエサを　たべなくても　へいきなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물과 태양이 있으면 등에 있는\n잎으로 에너지를 만들 수 있어서\n먹이를 먹지 않아도 괜찮다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tant qu’il a de l’eau et du soleil en abondance, ce\nPokémon n’a pas besoin de nourriture. Les feuilles sur\nson dos produisent son énergie par photosynthèse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solange es Wasser und Sonnenlicht hat, kann es mit\nden Blättern auf seinem Rücken Energie erzeugen.\nDeswegen kommt es auch ohne Futter zurecht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede generar energía con las hojas que tiene en la\nespalda disponiendo tan solo de agua y luz solar.\nGracias a ello puede sobrevivir sin comer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ricava energia dal sole e dall’acqua grazie alle foglie\nche ha sul dorso. In questo modo può sopravvivere\nanche senza mangiare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If it has sunshine and water, it doesn’t\nneed to eat, because it can generate\nenergy from the leaves on its back.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
